UPDATE companies SET description='Montana Precision Products operates from Butte, Montana, where it was established in 2012 as a joint venture between SeaCast, Inc. and GE Aviation.

The company produces welded tube and duct assemblies, small structural investment castings, and a newer line of flex joints designed to absorb thermal expansion and vibration in engine and airframe ducting systems. Its 97,000-square-foot facility houses vacuum and air melt furnaces for nickel super alloys, stainless and alloy steels, and cobalt alloys, along with 4-axis CNC machining centers, a horizontal turning center, and a range of welding and tube-forming equipment. About 190 employees work across two shifts, handling everything from melt chemical analysis to final inspection.

The flex joints product line, launched after the 2022 expansion, targets engine and aircraft ducting systems where movement absorption is critical. The company also serves commercial applications that require high-integrity metal components.

Leadership emphasizes a mission built on teamwork, technical innovation, and continual improvement to deliver net-shape castings and welded assemblies. The 2022 expansion added 56,000 square feet specifically to launch the flex joints line, which the board chairman described as a significant engineering and operational achievement that strengthens MPP''s role in the international aerospace supply chain.', certifications=ARRAY['AS9100D','Nadcap']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Vacuum melt (nickel super alloys up to 100 lbs)", "Air melt (stainless & alloy steels up to 400 lbs, cobalt alloys up to 400 lbs)", "Melt chemical analysis (OE spectrometers, nitrogen/oxygen analyzer)", "CNC machining (4-axis, high speed, 50\"x20\"x24\" work envelope)", "Horizontal turning (21\" diameter swing)", "Welded assemblies (stainless steel, nickel alloys)", "Tube forming (bend 3/8\" to 4.5\")", "Torch brazing", "CMM and Romer arm inspection", "Borescope inspection", "X-ray inspection", "Fluorescent penetrant testing", "Ultrasonic thickness testing", "Dry film coating", "Pressure testing", "Vacuum heat treatment"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Commercial"], "materials": ["Nickel super alloys", "Stainless steel", "Alloy steels", "Cobalt alloys", "Nickel alloys"], "equipment": ["OE Spectrometers", "Nitrogen/Oxygen Analyzer", "CMM", "Romer Arm", "Borescope", "X-Ray inspection system", "Horizontal Turning Center (21\" swing)", "4-axis CNC machining centers", "Vacuum melt furnace", "Air melt furnace"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["AS9100D certified aerospace manufacturing facility", "Nadcap-certified special processes (X-ray, fluorescent penetrant, vacuum heat treatment, torch braze)", "97,000 sq ft facility with integrated casting, machining, and welding", "Joint venture backing from GE Aviation and SeaCast", "Flex joints for thermal expansion and vibration absorption in aerospace ducting"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2012 -> db", "Joint venture between 