UPDATE companies SET description='MxD operates from Chicago, Illinois, where it was founded in 2014 as the Digital Manufacturing and Design Innovation Institute (DMDII). It is the second of 18 institutes in the Manufacturing USA network, a national initiative to secure the future of U.S. manufacturing through innovation, collaboration, and education. The institute was established in partnership with the U.S. Department of War, which remains a founding member and co-investor in its research and demonstration portfolio.

Members such as Siemens, EY, DMG MORI, and Betacom use the floor for experimentation with AI, robotics, AR/VR, digital twins, and 5G. MxD''s three pillars — convene, advance, empower — guide its work: convening manufacturers, academia, and government; advancing digital adoption and secure cybersecurity practices; and empowering the workforce through accessible learning tools. More than 350,000 learners have engaged with MxD Learn programs, and the Virtual Training Center offers online courses from AI to cybersecurity.

MxD serves the U.S. industrial base with a focus on defense collaboration. As the Department of War-designated National Center for Cybersecurity in Manufacturing, it develops programs to protect supply chains from cyber attacks, including a Cyber Resource Hub and CMMC compliance guidance. The institute works closely with the Organic Industrial Base — government-owned facilities that produce munitions and maintain weapon systems — to modernize Army and Marine Corps industrial operations. Its network of over 350 members spans industry, academia, and government.

MxD was created to transform the outdated image of manufacturing into a clean, safe, and visionary technology leader, improving productivity, quality, and global competitiveness. Its mission is to strengthen U.S. manufacturing competitiveness through technology innovation, workforce development, and cybersecurity preparedness, ensuring a reliable industrial backstop in times of war and emergency.', certifications=ARRAY['CMMC']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Convening industry, academia, and government for collaborative manufacturing innovation", "Digital manufacturing technology demonstration and experimentation", "Cybersecurity program development and supply chain protection", "CMMC compliance guidance and certification support", "Workforce development training and curriculum design (MxD Learn)", "Virtual Training Center for remote manufacturing education", "Workforce Readiness Guides for emerging manufacturing roles", "Defense industrial base modernization consulting", "5G wireless factory infrastructure deployment", "Digital twin, AI, robotics, and AR/VR integration support", "Supply chain security playbook development", "Cybersecurity for additive manufacturing"], "industries": ["Defense", "Manufacturing", "Cybersecurity", "Workforce Development", "Digital Manufacturing", "Supply Chain Security"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Solution-neutral advisor and convener for digital manufacturing and cybersecurity", "Department of War-designated National Center for Cybersecurity in Manufacturing", "22,000-square-foot Factory Floor for hands-on technology experimentation and workforce training", "Network of 350+ members across industry, academia, and government", "Over 350,000 learners engaged through MxD Learn workforce development programs"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2014 as DMDII -> /about", "Headquartered in Chicago, Illinois -> db", "Part of Manufacturing USA network of 18 institutes -> /about", "Partnership with U.S. Department of War -> /about and /", "22,000-square-foot Factory Floor -> /about", "Members include Siemens, EY, DMG MORI, Betacom -> /about", "350+ members -> /", "350,000+ learners engaged in MxD Learn -> /about", "Designated National Center for Cybersecurity in Manufacturing by Department of War -> /about", "Three pillars: Convene, Advance, Empower -> /", "Cyber Resource Hub and CMMC compliance guidance -> /about", "Works with Organic Industrial Base modernization -> /about", "Virtual Training Center offers online courses -> /about", "Workforce Readiness Guides for cybersecurity, EV, digital hiring -> /about", "Certification: CMMC -> db"], "company_type": "Other", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "MxD (Manufacturing x Digital), the nation''s Digital Manufacturing & Cybersecurity Institute, is a solution-neutral advisor and convener.", "founded_year": "2014", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='mxd' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
