UPDATE companies SET description='NetVia Group operates from Irving, Texas. Founded more than 35 years ago, the company became part of Epec Engineered Technologies in 2019, continuing a legacy of high-reliability printed circuit board manufacturing.

The company produces multi-layer rigid, flexible, and rigid-flex printed circuit boards, including high-density interconnect (HDI), RF/microwave, and hybrid designs. Its facility houses equipment such as 300,000 RPM mechanical drills, UV laser drills, laser direct imaging, reverse pulse plating, automated planarization, and a range of inspection systems including AOI, X-ray, and flying probe testers. The shop focuses on quick-turn, high-technology boards meeting IPC Class 2, 3, and 3/A standards.

Customers span defense and aerospace, telecommunications, commercial high-density interconnect, oil and gas, scientific, and medical sectors. The company highlights its ITAR registration and long history supplying military and defense programs, as well as providing PCBs for microwave phased-array antenna tiles and beamforming subassemblies.

NetVia Group emphasizes its heavy reinvestment in equipment and engineering to handle complex designs that other suppliers decline, and it targets turnaround times without compromising quality.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','AS9100','ITAR Registered','ISO/IEC 27001:2022','JCP Certification','UL Certification','IPC-6012 Classes 2, 3, 3/A','IPC-6013 Classes 2, 3','IPC-6018 Classes 2, 3, 3/A']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Multi-layer PCB fabrication", "Rigid PCB fabrication", "Flexible circuit fabrication", "Rigid-flex PCB fabrication", "HDI (High Density Interconnect) with microvias, blind/buried vias, via-in-pad, stacked/staggered vias", "RF/microwave PCB fabrication", "Embedded resistors", "ENEPIG surface finish", "Edge plating", "Hybrid/mixed material designs", "Controlled impedance", "Back drilling", "Wrap plating", "Reverse pulse plating", "Laser direct imaging (LDI)", "Automated planarization", "Flying probe electrical testing", "Automated optical inspection (AOI)", "X-ray inspection", "Cross-section analysis", "PCB design services", "Rogers material fabrication (RO4350, RO4003, RO6035HTC, RO6002, RO3006, TMM, 2929 bondply)", "Quick-turn manufacturing"], "industries": ["Defense & Aerospace", "Telecommunications", "Military and Defense", "Commercial HDI Circuit Boards", "Oil & Gas", "Scientific", "Medical", "Microwave/RF"], "materials": ["Rogers RO4350", "Rogers RO4003", "Rogers RO6035HTC", "Rogers RO6002", "Rogers RO3006", "Rogers TMM", "Rogers 2929 bondply"], "equipment": ["DLG 2+2 High Accuracy Drills (300,000 RPM spindles)", "ESI 5335 UV Laser Drill", "TRM-422 Four Spindle Router with CCD cameras", "SDL-620 Six Spindle Drill with CCD cameras", "Micro Vu Excel 661UC Precision Measurement System", "Advanced Multi-head DI/Laser Direct Imaging", "Orbotech Discovery II 8800 AOI", "Glenbrook X-Ray machine", "DP 1500 Screen Printer", "Microcraft EMMA E4M6151 flying probe electrical testing", "Handheld Cu thickness measurement", "High resolution micr