UPDATE companies SET description='Northwire Inc. was founded in 1972 and is headquartered in Osceola, Wisconsin, with a second manufacturing operation in Santa Teresa, New Mexico. The company designs and manufactures custom technical wire and cable interconnectivity solutions.

Northwire provides vertically integrated cable assembly services including cable preparation, wire termination, connector over-molding, and full cable assembly manufacturing. Its Osceola facility spans 115,250 square feet of manufacturing space and employs 250 people, while the Santa Teresa site adds 48,000 square feet and 50 team members.

The company serves a broad range of industries including medical devices, off-road heavy equipment, industrial automation, aerospace and defense, test and measurement, electronics and machinery, information and networking systems, communications and audiovisual, public sector and automotive, marine and underwater, green energy, and architectural lighting.

Northwire emphasizes its design engineering team, which has over three decades of experience, and offers rapid prototyping and expert guidance on compliance standards. It operates a qualified CSA test facility per ISO 17025:2017 and holds certifications to ISO 9001:2015, AS9100D, and ISO 13485:2016.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 13485:2016','AS9100D','ISO 17025:2017']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cable design", "Cable assembly preparation", "Wire and cable termination", "Connector over-molding", "Cable assembly manufacturing", "Over-molding", "Rapid prototyping", "Compliance testing (CSA)", "Vertically integrated manufacturing"], "industries": ["Medical Devices", "Off-Road Heavy Equipment", "Industrial Automation", "Aerospace & Defense", "Test & Measurement", "Electronics & Machinery", "Information & Networking Systems", "Communications & Audiovisual", "Public Sector & Automotive", "Marine & Underwater Use", "Green Energy", "Architectural Lighting"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Vertically integrated custom cable capabilities", "Design engineers with over three decades of experience", "Qualified CSA test facility per ISO 17025:2017", "Rapid prototyping services", "Certified to ISO 9001:2015, AS9100D, ISO 13485:2016"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1972 -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Osceola, Wisconsin -> /about-us", "Santa Teresa, New Mexico facility purchased in 2004 -> /about-us", "Osceola facility: 115,250 sq ft manufacturing, 250 team members -> /about-us", "Santa Teresa facility: 48,000 sq ft manufacturing, 50 team members -> /about-us", "Certifications: ISO 9001:2015, AS9100D, ISO 13485:2016 -> /about-us and /", "Qualified CSA test facility per ISO 17025:2017 -> /about-us", "Industries served listed on /about-us and /", "Vertically integrated custom cable capabilities -> / and /about-us", "Design engineers with over three decades of experience -> /", "Rapid prototypi