UPDATE companies SET description='Northlake Medical Supply was founded in 1983 in Covington, Louisiana, as a family-owned business serving the home medical equipment needs of St. Tammany, Washington, and Tangipahoa parishes. The company operates from its Covington location, supplying durable medical equipment and related services to patients, physicians, hospitals, and home care agencies across the three-parish region.

The company stocks and distributes a broad range of durable medical equipment, including therapeutic wraps and joint products, orthopedic soft goods, bathroom safety aids, lift chairs, scooters, manual and power wheelchairs, and portable and traditional oxygen supplies. Additional product lines cover hospital beds, patient lifts, sleep apnea devices, nebulizers, mastectomy products, and mobility aids such as walkers, canes, and transport chairs.

