UPDATE companies SET description='OSS Apparel operates from an 8,500-square-foot facility in East Providence, Rhode Island. The company was founded in 2015 by Mike Almeida, who began with a single heat press in a basement as a side hustle driven by a passion for entrepreneurship and hands-on creativity. Over the past decade, the business has grown into a full-service custom apparel shop rooted in Almeida’s blue-collar work ethic and local ties.

The shop provides screen printing, embroidery, direct-to-film (DTF) transfers, sublimation, banner production, promotional products, graphic design, and brand guide development. Production runs out of the East Providence facility, which added new equipment and a quality-assurance process during a recent re-grand opening. The team handles jobs ranging from one-off custom pieces to larger runs for schools, businesses, and organizations across the region.

OSS Apparel emphasizes word-of-mouth referrals and community partnerships, such as supporting local youth programs and collaborating with nonprofits to strengthen branding through apparel.

The company’s name stands for “Outstanding. Strategic. Service.”—a framework that guides its approach to personalized service, competitive pricing, a 100% satisfaction guarantee, and included graphic design support. Almeida started the venture to build something from the ground up, and the business now positions itself as a reliable print partner that prioritizes fast turnarounds and dependable quality.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Screen Printing", "Embroidery", "Direct to Film (DTF) Transfers", "Sublimation", "Banner Production", "Promotional Products", "Graphic Design", "Brand Guide Development", "Online Stores"], "industries": ["Schools", "Businesses", "Nonprofits", "Youth Programs", "Small Businesses", "Clothing Brands", "Event Organizers"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Personalized service tailored to each customer\u2019s needs", "Competitive pricing without compromising quality", "100% satisfaction guarantee on all work", "In-house graphic design support included", "Fast turnarounds and dependable quality"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2015 by Mike Almeida -> /about", "Started with one heat press in a basement -> /about", "Operates 8500 sq ft facility at 37 Tripps Ln, East Providence, RI -> /about, /", "Offers screen printing, embroidery, DTF, sublimation, banners, promotional products, graphic design, brand guides -> /about, /", "Serves schools, businesses, organizations, youth programs, nonprofits, small businesses -> /about", "Differentiators: personalized service, competitive pricing, 100% satisfaction guarantee, graphic design support, fast turnarounds -> /, /about", "OSS stands for Outstanding. Strategic. Service. -> /about", "Community-first business supporting local youth programs and nonprofits -> /about"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "OSS Apparel is a premier full-print company that offers sublimation, emb